WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:04.590
- [Main Speaker] Every country
on this planet has a story

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:06.450
about its founding,

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:08.280
whether it's about a group of rebels

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:10.140
trampling the global superpower.

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:12.326
- [Man] Mohandas Karamchand Gandhi.

00:00:12.326 --> 00:00:14.250
- [Main Speaker] Or, a passivist
delivering independence

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:15.903
for the second largest
country on the planet.

00:00:15.903 --> 00:00:16.736
- [Man] And, he's been called

00:00:16.736 --> 00:00:18.390
the most powerful man of the 20th century.

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:21.660
- Or, some dude pulling
out a sword from a rock.

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:25.050
Usually, somewhat fabricated
and polished ideas

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:27.870
of where the country came
from, what it stands for.

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:30.903
- [All] Hail King Arthur.
Long live the king.

00:00:30.903 --> 00:00:33.450
- But, China's story is different.

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:37.508
China's story is a new story
and it is tightly controlled.

00:00:37.508 --> 00:00:39.755
(people shouting)

00:00:39.755 --> 00:00:41.490
It's a story that is
being used as a weapon,

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:43.980
a weapon to subjugate millions of people,

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:46.080
to eliminate ancient cultures,

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:48.600
to expand China's borders farther

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.373
than they've ever pushed before.

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:54.930
It's a founding myth that can't
be challenged within China.

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:56.580
And, it has been so heavily pedaled

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:59.460
and thoroughly implanted
into the Chinese psyche,

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:03.810
that most people believe that
China actually looks like this

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:06.570
and that it has always looked like this,

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:08.400
but China doesn't look like this.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:12.000
China actually looks a lot more like this,

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.000
but only if you look at the
real history, the facts,

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:15.833
and the evidence,

00:01:15.833 --> 00:01:18.030
which is something you can't
really do within China.

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:20.190
So, instead, the communist
party has created

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:23.940
and weaponized the myth of
this over the past 70 years

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:27.060
to erase these borders, to build islands,

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:28.500
to threaten neighbors,

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:31.830
and to undertake one of the
largest assimilation projects

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:33.060
in human history.

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:35.910
It's a project that has cost
them trillions of dollars

00:01:35.910 --> 00:01:37.680
and has been responsible for countless,

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:39.660
horrific human rights violations,

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:43.110
all in the name of preserving
a pretend version of history.

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:44.370
A version that China believes

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.830
will keep the communist party in power

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:50.790
and make China the richest,
most powerful country on Earth.

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:54.750
And, what's scary is it just might work.

